{"type":"message","id":"636dd0a5","parentId":"7ef676b8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T12:02:33.541Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the root endpoint works and returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\", but the /send endpoint throws error 1101 (Worker exception). The /send endpoint might have a bug or might not be fully implemented. This is a platform issue, not an authentication issue.\n\nLet me report back what I found:\n- GET /history works ✅\n- POST /send returns error 1101 (Worker exception) ❌\n- No human messages found in either thread\n- The platform appears to be a self-monitoring system with automated heartbeats\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 12:00 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常（X-API-Key header） |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ Error 1101（Worker执行异常，endpoint可能未上线或存在bug） |\n| **arbitration线程** | 最新消息：23:50 UTC系统心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| **general线程** | 最新消息：23:45 UTC C轨同步，无人类讨论 |\n| **待响应讨论** | 无（均为自动化系统心跳消息） |\n\n**发现的问题**：平台 `/send` 接口返回 Cloudflare 1101 Worker异常，无法主动发消息到线程。建议检查该endpoint的Worker实现。GET接口正常，双线程心跳信息已读取但因发送失败无法回复。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18968,"output":289,"cacheRead":224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19481,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779278544650,"responseId":"chatcmpl-366f379a-2a6f-4adb-a34c-8e647cda7e52"}}
